  data: {
    LLM: 'Remember cards left in denominations 9–K and point-carrying cards picked up. Try to leave only two items on the floor when possible.\n\nEnsure your side is last to pick up so you take remaining loose cards at end. Cement houses you want to keep; pick up with point cards if you fear the house will be broken or taken.\n\nIf you and partner hold all four of a denomination, build a cemented house in that value; opponents cannot break or capture it. Use house ownership and card memory to force favourable end-game.',
    Player: 'Remember cards left in denominations 9–K and point-carrying cards picked up. Try to leave only two items on the floor when possible.\n\nEnsure your side is last to pick up so you take remaining loose cards at end. Cement houses you want to keep; pick up with point cards if you fear the house will be broken or taken.\n\nIf you and partner hold all four of a denomination, build a cemented house in that value; opponents cannot break or capture it. Use house ownership and card memory to force favourable end-game.',
